## What Is This Project?

**{{project.name}}** — {{project.description}}

- **Archetype:** {{project.archetype}}
- **Framework:** Quarkus (Java {{project.java.javaVersion}})
- **Architecture:** DDD + Onion Architecture + CQRS
- **Build:** Maven
{{#if project.features.frontend}}
- **Frontend:** React{{#if project.frontend.toolkit}} + DarkHorse Toolkit{{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{#if (eq project.archetype "api")}}
> **API archetype** — Standard REST service with persistence and full domain logic.
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq project.archetype "bff-api")}}
> **BFF-API archetype** — Backend-for-Frontend routing layer. No persistence, no domain logic execution. Queries route to downstream APIs, commands dispatch to a message broker.
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq project.archetype "microservice")}}
> **Microservice archetype** — Message-driven service. Listens for commands/events from a broker, executes domain logic, owns its data. Not HTTP-first.
{{/if}}

